                "incorrect": "Son, with ustedes."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is the vosotros form of ser? (Sois.) What Latin word is it worn from? (Estis.) And why is this verb so short everywhere? (Because it is said constantly, and constant use grinds words down.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
